(1316, 'options_all_feedbacks_3_feedback_texts', 'As Mother Teresa had said, “Every time you smile at someone, it is an action of love, a gift to that person, a beautiful thing.” ;RAMDHANU the colour of hope is like a beam of rays that enlighten the lives of hundreds of children in need. Being a Pediatrician, I am fortunate to serve the noble mission by Mitrobinda di and team, during the health checkup camps. Many of my close friends like Doyel, Shalmoli and Antaripa are doing great work by devoting their heart and soul into the organisation and I wish all the very best to RAMDHANU.', 'no'),
(1317, '_options_all_feedbacks_3_feedback_texts', 'field_644b7396b95d0', 'no'),
(1318, 'options_all_feedbacks_3_person_name', 'Dr. Nibedita Manna', 'no'),
