(6711, 52, 'section_4_contents_0_section4_title', '<h3>Nandini: Our Ray of Hope</h3>\r\nNandini, a 2-year-old girl, was born in a remote tribal village in Jharkhand and was blind since birth. Her parents could not raise her and sent her to a blind home. During a visit to the home for food distribution, the moment, our secretary hugged her she started clinging to her tightly and immediately felt a connection with her. Our team decided to take responsibility for Nandini\'s well-being, offering monetary, medical, and overall developmental assistance. As a result, our society now bears all the expenses of Nandini, and she has become an inseparable part of our lives. Our project, \"Ray of Hope,\" revolves around her, and we hope to support more children like Nandini in the future. We visit Nandini regularly at the blind home, and she receives all the attention and care she deserves from our team members. Join us in spreading hope in the lives of children like Nandini who need it the most.'),
