(13527, 894, 'section_4_contents_0_section4_title', '<h3>Who We Empower</h3>\r\n<p>Tribal mothers who dream of a better life for their children</p>\r\n<p>Urban slum dwellers and young women who never had the chance to learn or earn</p>\r\n<p>Children and teenagers who channel their creativity into something meaningful</p>'),
