(15039, 940, 'section_4_contents_2_section4_title', '<h3>How You Can Help</h3>\r\nBuy a product. Spread a story of hope.\r\nEach item supports a life, a dream, and a future.\r\n\r\nPartner with us to conduct skill workshops, sponsor training kits, or host exhibitions.'),
