(281, 1, '2023-05-04 05:52:02', '2023-05-04 05:52:02', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Supporting Marginalized Children\'s Education</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society is committed to helping children living in difficult circumstances, including orphans and visually impaired children. In the Southern Avenue area of Kolkata, the organization has identified a cluster of 28 children who are either living on the street or in a temporary shelter near Kalighat. With the help of volunteers, the organization has been providing educational, nutritional, and medical support to these children. They have also been arranging regular workshops, cultural events, and meetings with parents to encourage the children\'s progress and uplift their spirits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In addition to their work in Kolkata, the Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society has also started a project in the Murgabani village of Birbhum district to support the children in tribal villages who are struggling with poverty and lack of education. While the organization is new and actively seeking funds to support their activities, they have already started supplying educational materials and arranging workshops on drawing, painting, and crafts for the children in the village. Their team is assessing more opportunities to support the children of this village and looking for generous funders who can help fulfill the children\'s needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a small organization with big dreams, Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society is committed to ensuring that all children who have been marginalized by society have the right to livelihood and education. They have dared to pursue their dream and expand their projects to support more children in need. The organization will regularly update their supporters on their activities and work on child rights, and they invite others to join them in their efforts to make a difference in the lives of these children.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Beyond Boundaries', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '54-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-05-04 05:52:02', '2023-05-04 05:52:02', '', 54, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=281', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
