(356, 1, '2023-05-05 13:26:22', '2023-05-05 13:26:22', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Ramdhanu annually celebrates Children\'s Day by organizing a sports event for the street children. The event includes various fun competitions and games such as running, frog jumping, marble and spoon race, as well as intellectual challenges like memory games. Winners are awarded medals and prizes, and the day concludes with food and juices. Additionally, Ramdhanu conducts Yoga workshops on International Yoga Day to spread awareness of the benefits of yoga among underprivileged children and includes yoga as part of their education plan. Ramdhanu also regularly organizes self-defense classes, especially for girls, to teach children how to defend themselves and fight off intruders with the help of Sreejata Dutta, a 1st dan black belt Taekwondo artist.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Sports Events', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'sports-events', '', '', '2024-07-28 06:53:31', '2024-07-28 06:53:31', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?page_id=356', 0, 'event', '', 0),
