(591, 1, '2023-10-15 16:56:40', '2023-10-15 16:56:40', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On October 1, 2023, we ventured into Murgaboni Village, Bolpur, for a remarkable day under our \"Beyond Boundaries\" project. This initiative, made possible through the generosity of our dedicated donors, was a testament to our commitment to making a positive impact. We distributed 100 drawing kits, 120 cakes, 120 biscuits, 120 food packets, and 30 hair accessories to brighten the day for these resilient children. Additionally, we extended our support to 4 talented but underprivileged girls, providing them with essential study materials as they prepare for their 10th standard board examinations. Rain couldn\'t dampen our spirits as we pushed forward, determined to bring smiles to these young faces. Explore the heartwarming gallery of images from this inspiring day of giving and hope.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Beyond Boundaries - A Day of Giving and Hope', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '576-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-10-15 16:56:40', '2023-10-15 16:56:40', '', 576, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=591', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
