(593, 1, '2023-10-20 06:36:56', '2023-10-20 06:36:56', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the realm of social impact, the Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society stands as a beacon of hope, illuminating the lives of those who have lost their way amidst life\'s challenges. Our journey, much like that of many nonprofits, has been characterized by unwavering dedication and persistent efforts, often in the face of limited resources and a constant need for support. Yet, amidst these challenges, we\'ve discovered the power of recognition and the transformative impact it can have on our mission.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A Silent Struggle for Support:</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our quest to make a difference has often led us to seek assistance from those with the ability to amplify our cause. We reached out to celebrities, their associates, reporters, and well-wishers, hoping that a little bit of publicity would help us garner the necessary funds to sustain our efforts. Unfortunately, these requests often went unanswered, leaving us feeling discouraged yet determined to continue our work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">An Unexpected Ray of Hope:</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In a serendipitous turn of events, our story found its way into the spotlight through an unexpected source. A video captured by renowned actor Saurav Das, showcasing our dedicated volunteer Sneha providing educational support to a child on the pavement, went viral. This simple act, a reflection of our daily commitment, caught the attention of someone with influence, bringing our work into the public eye. We extend our heartfelt gratitude to Saurav Das for his kindness and recognition of our efforts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A Tribute to Our Tireless Team:</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While recognition is heartwarming, it is our incredible team that truly deserves the spotlight. Their unwavering hard work has transformed Ramdhanu into a sanctuary where children who have lost hope can dream of a brighter future. To Sumana Bhattacharjee, Abhijit Dalai, Sachidanand Tripathi, Antaripa Banik, Amisha Kumari, Niloy Dhar, Rano Jeet, Shalmoli Ghosh, Abherii, and Kaushik, our backbone, we express our deepest gratitude. Your relentless commitment has shaped our mission.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A Touching Acknowledgement:</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Recently, we received a heartwarming Pujo gift - a remarkable article in the renowned Bengali newspaper, <a href=\"http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Etc_Anandabazar_17-10-2023_compressed-pdf.pdf\">Anandabazar Patrika</a>. This recognition has warmed our hearts and reaffirmed the purpose of our work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gratitude to Our Supporters:</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To our well-wishers, who have stood by us throughout this arduous journey, we extend our deepest gratitude. Your unwavering support and motivation empower us to continue working under the scorching sun, providing a glimmer of hope for those who need it most.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Recognition of Hard Work is the Best Pujo Gift', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'recognition-of-hard-work-is-the-best-pujo-gift', '', '', '2023-10-20 06:37:00', '2023-10-20 06:37:00', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=593', 0, 'post', '', 0),
