(712, 1, '2024-04-17 10:34:09', '2024-04-17 10:34:09', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are thrilled to announce a momentous occasion for Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society (TRSWS). On April 12, 2024, we had the honor of being nominated by Punjab National Bank (PNB) for their Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) project, specifically under the Beti Bachao Beti Padhao initiative. This recognition not only validates our ongoing efforts but also inspires us to continue our mission of uplifting underprivileged children.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The felicitation ceremony took place at the Zonal office of PNB in Kolkata, where the TRSWS team was warmly welcomed. It was a day filled with gratitude and excitement as we received educational materials such as school bags, tiffin boxes, pencil boxes, and water bottles, along with new clothes for all 30 children in our Kolkata cluster. These essentials are invaluable for ensuring the well-being and educational advancement of the children we serve.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We extend our heartfelt thanks to the management of PNB for selecting us for this significant CSR initiative. Their support and recognition fuel our commitment to making a positive impact on the lives of marginalized children, not only in Kolkata but also in Murgaboni Village. We pledge to reciprocate this gesture by expanding our reach and catering to the needs of even more deserving children in our communities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This nomination serves as a testament to the dedication and hard work of our team members, volunteers, and supporters who tirelessly champion our cause. Together, we are determined to create a brighter and more promising future for every child we encounter.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As we move forward, we are filled with renewed motivation and enthusiasm to continue our journey of empowerment and transformation. With the unwavering support of organizations like PNB and the collective effort of our community, we are confident that we can make a meaningful difference in the lives of those who need it most.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We express our deepest gratitude to PNB for this incredible opportunity and look forward to forging stronger partnerships and creating greater impact in the days to come. Together, we can build a world where every child has the opportunity to thrive and succeed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Celebrating a Milestone: Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society Nominated for PNB CSR Project', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'celebrating-a-milestone-tollygunge-ramdhanu-social-welfare-society-nominated-for-pnb-csr-project', '', '', '2024-04-17 10:34:13', '2024-04-17 10:34:13', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=712', 0, 'post', '', 0),
