(740, 1, '2024-06-22 14:37:10', '2024-06-22 14:37:10', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thank you for considering supporting Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society. Your contribution can make a significant difference in the lives of underprivileged children and help us continue our mission of bringing hope and empowerment to those in need.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Donate us Via QR or NEFT/IMPS on Below Bank Account:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Bank Details:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Account Number:</strong> 41543326156 </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Account Name:</strong> Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>IFSC Code:</strong> SBIN0007026</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":735,\"sizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium\"><img src=\"http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/WhatsApp-Image-2024-06-22-at-6.50.23-PM-2-226x300.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-735\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online Gateway: You can also make a donation through our secure online gateway by visiting the following link: <a href=\"https://daankosh.com/@hoperamdhanu\">https://daankosh.com/@hoperamdhanu</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tax Benefits: We would like to inform you that all donations made to Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society are 80G compliant and tax-free. Your support not only makes a positive impact on the lives of vulnerable children but also provides you with tax benefits as per applicable regulations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your Contribution Matters: Every donation, no matter the size, is valuable and greatly appreciated. Your support enables us to provide essential resources, education, healthcare, and a better future for the children we serve. With your generosity, we can continue our efforts to break the cycle of poverty and create lasting change.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact Us: If you have any questions or require further information, please feel free to reach out to us. We are grateful for your interest in supporting Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society, and we look forward to partnering with you in our mission to create a brighter future for underprivileged children.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thank you for your generosity and support!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Support Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '158-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-06-22 14:37:10', '2024-06-22 14:37:10', '', 158, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=740', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(744, 1, '2024-07-28 04:31:34', '2024-07-28 04:31:34', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">An Empowerment Initiative of Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hopes &amp; Hues is more than a project; it’s a heartfelt movement where brushes, needles, and threads become tools of liberation. Three years ago, Ramdhanu began this journey with a simple dream: to help children and tribal women break free from limitations through the transformative power of art, skill, and self-expression.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the heart of Kolkata, our older children create beautiful artworks – from vibrant paintings and delicate quilling to hand embroidery and crochet, expressing untold stories and quiet victories. Far away, in a remote tribal village, two women, who had never held a needle before, now run their own thriving tailoring and embroidery unit with confidence and pride.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Through Hopes &amp; Hues, we offer dignity, opportunity, and hope – in every stitch, every brushstroke, every handmade creation. Their work, now showcased in vibrant fairs, seasonal markets, and prestigious exhibitions, earns them admiration, income, and respect. These children and women are artisans, earners, and change-makers, and Ramdhanu stands by them, helping them shape a future that is not only colourful, but courageous.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Hopes &amp; Hues', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'hopes-hues', '', '', '2025-08-11 07:20:09', '2025-08-11 07:20:09', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?page_id=744', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(745, 1, '2024-07-28 04:31:34', '2024-07-28 04:31:34', '', 'Hopes &amp; Hues', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '744-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-07-28 04:31:34', '2024-07-28 04:31:34', '', 744, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=745', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(747, 1, '2024-07-28 04:50:39', '2024-07-28 04:50:39', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hopes &amp; Hues: Unleashing Creativity, Fostering Dreams</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hopes &amp; Hues is a vibrant initiative by Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society designed to harness the transformative power of art and creativity. This project aims to nurture the artistic talents of underprivileged children, providing them with the tools, guidance, and opportunities to express themselves, build self-confidence, and dream beyond their circumstances.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our mission is to use art as a medium to unlock the potential within every child. We believe that creativity can pave the way for a brighter future, fostering not just individual growth but also building a sense of community and belonging.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Hopes &amp; Hues', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '744-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-07-28 04:50:39', '2024-07-28 04:50:39', '', 744, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=747', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
