(777, 1, '2024-09-12 12:00:51', '2024-09-12 12:00:51', 'The Hopes and Hues project, an initiative of Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society, empowers marginalized children and women by teaching them vocational skills like stitching, painting, and crafting. The recent success at \"The Trunk – Puja Edit\" exhibition showcased their beautifully embroidered shirts, tote bags, stoles, and hand-painted coasters, all crafted with love by the children. The event not only highlighted their talents but also provided them with an opportunity to gain financial independence, reinforcing the project\'s mission of transforming lives through creativity and skill development.', 'Tollygunge Ramdhanu\'s Project Shines Bright at \"The Trunk – Puja Edit\"', 'The Hopes and Hues project, an initiative of Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society, empowers marginalized children...', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'tollygunge-ramdhanus-project-shines-bright-at-the-trunk-puja-edit', '', '', '2024-09-12 12:00:51', '2024-09-12 12:00:51', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?post_type=event&#038;p=777', 0, 'event', '', 0),
