(803, 1, '2024-10-04 18:31:03', '2024-10-04 18:31:03', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On the 29th of September 2024, Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society celebrated Durga Puja in a truly extraordinary way with the event titled \"অন্যরকম আগমনী.\" Unlike traditional festivities, this event shined a light on the journey and spirit of children who have been born and raised on the streets. These underprivileged children, often deprived of many joys that others take for granted, became the heart of the celebration, symbolizing the arrival of hope and happiness before Durga Puja.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The day was packed with cultural activities, including vibrant dance performances and heart-touching poetry recitations. The children, with the help of volunteers and mentors, showcased their immense talent and passion through these performances, bringing a sense of pride and excitement to the community. The event was not just a celebration of Durga Puja, but also a platform for these children to express themselves and find their place in the cultural landscape.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A highlight of the day was the involvement of Bengali media, with <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Aajkaal/videos/523592430377900\">Aajkaal News covering</a> the event and bringing attention to the meaningful work being done by Tollygunge Ramdhanu. This media coverage amplified the reach of the event, allowing the larger public to witness how the joy of Durga Puja can transcend boundaries and uplift the spirits of those who need it the most.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"অন্যরকম আগমনী\" was more than just a celebration; it was a reminder that the true essence of Durga Puja lies in bringing light and hope to every corner of society. As the children danced, recited, and laughed, it became clear that they too were an integral part of the festive spirit, and their dreams deserve to be celebrated as much as anyone else\'s.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This year’s Durga Puja at Tollygunge Ramdhanu was a reflection of how much can be achieved when a community comes together with compassion, love, and an inclusive vision.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'অন্যরকম আগমনী: A Unique Prelude to Durga Puja', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e0%a6%85%e0%a6%a8%e0%a7%8d%e0%a6%af%e0%a6%b0%e0%a6%95%e0%a6%ae-%e0%a6%86%e0%a6%97%e0%a6%ae%e0%a6%a8%e0%a7%80-a-unique-prelude-to-durga-puja', '', '', '2024-10-04 18:33:00', '2024-10-04 18:33:00', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=803', 0, 'post', '', 0),
