(905, 1, '2025-05-05 14:09:01', '2025-05-05 14:09:01', '<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bXZm7fvJ9d8\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bXZm7fvJ9d8\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every girl who appeared for the Madhyamik exams under the guidance of Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society—from the bustling streets of Kolkata to the quiet strength of Murgaboni village—has passed with flying colors!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Priyanka and Sonia, who once dropped out of school, joined us just four years ago. Today, they stand as powerful symbols of resilience, determination, and change. And Lokkhimoni Hansda, a dedicated young woman from the tribal community who now leads our learning centre in Murgaboni, has also excelled.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Ramdhanu, women uplift women. It’s a space where everyday miracles unfold.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To our well-wishers: your love and unwavering support make all of this possible. This achievement is ours—together.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Media Coverage:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We’ve been incredibly grateful for the attention this story has received. You can read more about it in these articles:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://www.eimuhurte.com/kolkata/priyanka-and-sonia-passed-madhyamik-examination-by-studying-on-the-footpath/#google_vignette\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Ei Muhurte Media Coverage</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://www.thewall.in/west-bengal/wb-madhyamik-result-2025-sonia-priyanka-pass-madhyamik-from-the-foothpath/tid/157412?sfnsn=wiwspwa#google_vignette\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Thewall.in Media Coverage</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://www.anandabazar.com/education-career/priyanka-pramanik-and-sonia-ghosh-passed-their-secondary-exams-while-living-on-the-pavement-dgtl/cid/1599677\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Ananda Bazar Media Coverage</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->', 'A Proud Milestone and a Story of Transformation!', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '900-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-05-05 14:09:01', '2025-05-05 14:09:01', '', 900, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=905', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
